  {
    "id": 1802001000510010,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "今日は最悪な日ね\r\n晴れ予報だったのに思いきり降られちゃったわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "802",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100051/1802001000510010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雨？　今は降ってないみたいだが\r\nいつの話だ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000510020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "早朝よ\r\n走り込みしてたら急に降ってきて、ずぶ濡れになったの",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100051/1802001000510020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "レッスン以外に走り込みもしてたのか……\r\nお疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "頑張ってるんだな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000511"
  },
  {
    "select": "風邪を引かないようにな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000512"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "次に走る時は\r\n気をつけよう",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000513"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000510030,
    "label": "1802001000511",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "走り込みくらい、やって当然でしょ\r\n役者もアイドルも、体力は大事なんだし",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100051/1802001000510030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000510040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "たしかに雨は最悪だったけど\r\nあなたに褒められたのはよかったわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100051/1802001000510040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000510050,
    "label": "1802001000512",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "心配無用よ\r\nちゃんとあったまったし、着替えたから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100051/1802001000510050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000510060,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "髪だってちゃんと乾いてるでしょ？\r\nここに来る途中で降られなくてよかったわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100051/1802001000510060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000510070,
    "label": "1802001000513",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "私だって雲行きが怪しかったら、対策するわよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100051/1802001000510070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000510080,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "でも今日は晴れ予報だったし、出るときも晴れてたの！\r\n私が準備不足だったわけじゃないんだから",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100051/1802001000510080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うっ……しまった。別のことを言えば良かったな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
